{"entity_id":"item.herb","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Herb / 药草","language":"zh","aliases":["Herb","药草","草药"],"description_short":"药草是基础回复道具，早期可用来补充治疗精神力不足时的安全性。","description_long":"新手不用刻意囤到最后。早期迷宫里如果 PP 紧张，给前排或速度合适的角色带一些药草，会比硬撑更稳。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"verified","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.herb.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["药草要不要留","草药什么时候用","前期回复道具怎么用"],"answer":"药草是早期基础回复道具，不用一直囤。迷宫或 Boss 前给前排和速度合适的角色带一些，可以补足精神力治疗的空档。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.nut","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Nut / 坚果","language":"zh","aliases":["Nut","坚果"],"description_short":"坚果是比药草更强的回复道具，适合留给迷宫深处或 Boss 战中的紧急回复。","description_long":"如果还不熟队伍速度，坚果最好放在行动顺序可靠的角色身上。它能在治疗精神力来不及时救场。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"verified","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.nut.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["坚果有什么用","坚果要留吗"],"answer":"坚果是较强的回复道具，适合留给迷宫深处或 Boss 战救急。放在行动顺序可靠的角色身上更稳。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.elixir","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Elixir / 万灵药","language":"zh","aliases":["Elixir","万灵药"],"description_short":"万灵药用于处理异常状态类问题，适合在远离城镇或治疗点时保留备用。","description_long":"Lite 包不列完整异常表。原则是：普通回复解决不了的状态问题，先看背包里有没有万灵药或类似状态恢复手段。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"verified","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.elixir.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["万灵药有什么用","异常状态怎么办"],"answer":"万灵药偏向处理异常状态。远离城镇或治疗点时留一两个备用，能避免队伍被状态拖垮。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.psy-crystal","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Psy Crystal / 精神水晶","language":"zh","aliases":["Psy Crystal","精神水晶","精神水精"],"description_short":"精神水晶用于恢复 PP，适合在长迷宫或关键战斗前后处理精神力资源压力。","description_long":"如果地图解谜和治疗都大量消耗 PP，精神水晶就不要随手浪费。它更适合留给长迷宫、灯塔段落或 Boss 前后的资源恢复。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.localized_name_audit","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.psy-crystal.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["精神水晶有什么用","PP 不够怎么办","精神力点数不够"],"answer":"精神水晶用于恢复 PP。长迷宫里精神力既要解谜又要战斗，最好别随手用完，留给灯塔或 Boss 前后的资源压力更合适。","source_refs":["gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.venus-djinn","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Venus Djinn / 金星精灵","language":"zh","aliases":["Venus Djinn","金星精灵","金星迪金","地精灵"],"description_short":"金星精灵是土/金星元素精灵桶，通常与伊萨克的基础元素相配。","description_long":"作为 Lite 包，它只回答元素桶和分配方向，不列每只精灵的位置。问“所有金星精灵在哪”应进入扩展包或提示当前证据不足。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.venus-djinn.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["金星精灵给谁","金星迪金是什么","地精灵怎么分"],"answer":"金星精灵可以先给伊萨克，保持职业和精神力简单稳定。这个 Lite 包不列全部金星精灵位置。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.mars-djinn","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Mars Djinn / 火星精灵","language":"zh","aliases":["Mars Djinn","火星精灵","火精灵"],"description_short":"火星精灵是火元素精灵桶，早期通常与加雷特的基础元素相配。","description_long":"新手先按本元素分配能减少职业混乱。想试混搭时，先确认队伍治疗和主要输出没有被换掉。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.mars-djinn.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["火星精灵给谁","火精灵怎么分"],"answer":"火星精灵早期先给加雷特最直观，能保持他的前排和输出定位。等熟悉职业系统后再尝试混搭。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.jupiter-djinn","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Jupiter Djinn / 木星精灵","language":"zh","aliases":["Jupiter Djinn","木星精灵","风精灵"],"description_short":"木星精灵是风元素精灵桶，早期通常与伊万的基础元素相配。","description_long":"它会影响速度、精神力和职业方向。新手若不想让伊万技能乱掉，先保持本元素配置即可。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.jupiter-djinn.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["木星精灵给谁","风精灵怎么分"],"answer":"木星精灵早期先给伊万比较稳，能减少职业和精神力突然变化。想混搭时先小范围试。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.mercury-djinn","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Mercury Djinn / 水星精灵","language":"zh","aliases":["Mercury Djinn","水星精灵","水精灵"],"description_short":"水星精灵是水元素精灵桶，早期通常与米娅的治疗定位相配。","description_long":"如果米娅承担治疗，就不要在关键战斗前随意换走她的水星精灵，否则治疗相关精神力和职业可能变化。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.community_wiki","gs.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.gs.mercury-djinn.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["水星精灵给谁","水精灵怎么分"],"answer":"水星精灵早期先给米娅最稳，因为她常承担治疗定位。Boss 前别随便换走，免得治疗精神力变化。","source_refs":["gs.official_manual","gs.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
